ng"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Refactored existing `ask` function into `askOnce` to isolate individual requests.","Added an `ask` wrapper that implements a 3-try retry loop with exponential backoff (2s * iteration).","Targeted failures like 429 rate-limiting and intermittent JSON parsing errors common with free models."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/scripts/ai/generate-comprehensive.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvkl8q2_0b9242863547","importance":5,"narrative":"The API interaction for AI sports predictions was prone to failure due to unstable responses or rate limits from external models. I extracted the request logic into `askOnce` and wrapped it in a resilient `ask` function that performs up to three retries, ensuring the script is more robust when processing large batches of match data.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Added retry wrapper for API calls to handle rate-limiting and malformed JSON","timestamp":"2026-06-01T18:56:43.343Z","title":"Implement retry logic with backoff for AI predictions","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvkm3qs_e1f8c4af48a7":{"concepts":["AI model orchestration","Predictive modeling","Automated scripts"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Target date: 2026-06-01","Models used: Owl Alpha, GPT-OSS 120B, Nemotron Super 120B","GPT-OSS 120B successfully generated 1 prediction (Colombia vs Costa Rica)","Owl Alpha and Nemotron Super reported 0 new predictions with 2 skipped each"],"files":["scripts/ai/generate-comprehensive.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvkm3qs_e1f8c4af48a7","importance":4,"narrative":"The daily prediction script was executed to process matches for 2026-06-01. GPT-OSS 120B produced a successful result for the Colombia vs Costa Rica match, while other models skipped the scheduled entries.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Scripts executed: ai:predict-full","timestamp":"2026-06-01T18:57:23.547Z","title":"Executed daily AI prediction batch for 2026-06-01","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvkusxt_e45a0cced789":{