20:16:41.246Z","title":"Inject currentUser prop into component hierarchy","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvngca6_d67ff4e21b19":{"concepts":["React component styling","UI/UX refinement","Tailwind CSS","Component props mapping"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Changed `id` binding from `prediction.id` to `prediction.aiUserId` in `onChallengeClick` handler","Updated CSS class from `scoru-chip` to `scoru-duel`","Added active state scaling and enhanced shadow styling","Removed responsive visibility constraints on \"Provoacă\" label"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/react/ComprehensiveAIPredictions.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpvngca6_d67ff4e21b19","importance":5,"narrative":"The challenge button was updated to correctly reference `aiUserId` for the challenge action. The UI styling was upgraded to a high-contrast accent style using custom `oklch` colors and dynamic box shadows to match the `scoru-duel` component aesthetic.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"ComprehensiveAIPredictions.tsx","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:16:53.515Z","title":"Update challenge button ID and styling","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvngi9z_40d23750ffa3":{"concepts":["CSS transitions","React component styling","UI polish"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Removed .scoru-chip:hover state styling","Added .scoru-duel:hover transform animation","Kept .scoru-unlock:hover transform animation"],"files":["src/components/react/ComprehensiveAIPredictions.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpvngi9z_40d23750ffa3","importance":4,"narrative":"Cleaned up CSS hover states within the prediction component by removing an unused chip hover style and adding a specific hover transform for duel elements to improve UI feedback consistency.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Update ComprehensiveAIPredictions.tsx CSS","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:17:01.291Z","title":"Refine hover states for SCORU prediction cards","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvngxw2_2ccfaa955f5d":{"concepts":["REST API","JSON validation","Integration testing"],"confidence":1,"facts":["API endpoint /api/challenges/create successfully accepted the request.","Created challenge ID: kfjrepgu5bjo9psh2xe8skwd","Post-transaction balance returned: 9950","Prediction schema validated: exact_score, over_under_goals, both_teams_score, first_goalscorer"],"files":["/api/challenges/create"],"id":"obs_mpvngxw2_2ccfaa955f5d","importance":5,"narrative":"Executed a curl request to verify the challenge creation endpoint with a mock payload. The request was successful, returning a valid challenge ID and updated user balance, confirming the schema alignment for match predictions.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Verified duel creation via POST /api/challenges/create","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:17:21.525Z","title":"Test challenge creation API endpoint","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvnhbbz_77ba911fad66":{"concepts":["database verification","API validation","HTTP 409 Conflict","transaction integrity"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Verified latest 'pred_challenges', 'pred_predictions', and 'auth_crystal_transactions' table entries.","Toro user ('br4d7t929128xzzvb08f0zxt') balance confirmed at 9950 crystals after -50 bet.","API duplicate guard confirmed: '/api/challenges/create' returns 409 for repeated challenge submissions."],"files":["scripts/ai/_verify-duel.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvnhbbz_77ba911fad66","importance":5,"narrative":"Executed a diagnostic script to check the state of the database following a duel transaction and verified that the API correctly enforces duplicate submission constraints with a 409 conflict status code.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Database inspection and API 409 validation","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:17:38.943Z","title":"Verify DB State and Duplicate Challenge Guard","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvnhl71_9a52ec31e408":{"concepts":["database cleanup","data migration","PostgreSQL","transactional integrity"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Target user ID: br4d7t929128xzzvb08f0zxt","Deleted entries from auth_crystal_transactions, pred_challenges, and pred_predictions","Reset auth_users.crystals_current to 10,000","Temporary cleanup script automatically removed after execution"],"files":["scripts/ai/_cleanup-duel.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvnhl71_9a52ec31e408","importance":5,"narrative":"Performed a manual cleanup of test duel data for a specific user to ensure a clean state for further development. The process involved deleting related transaction/challenge records and resetting the user's currency balance via a temporary TypeScript script.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Cleaned up test duel records and reset user crystal balance","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:17:51.731Z","title":"Reset user duel state and TORO balance","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvnhv0z_3f9521021a74":{"concepts":["browser automation","MCP evaluation","client-side navigation"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Server ID: 8d649527-49e9-494f-b9e7-39dfad7f6b82","Operation attempted: programmatic page navigation via location.href","Failure reason: \"Inspected target navigated or closed\""],"files":[],"id":"obs_mpvnhv0z_3f9521021a74","importance":5,"narrative":"An attempt to trigger a client-side navigation within the evaluation environment caused the browser context to close or reset. The tool failed because the environment could not maintain connection through the page transition initiated by the script.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"mcp__Claude_Preview__preview_eval failed after navigation","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:18:04.473Z","title":"Browser evaluation navigation failure","type":"error"},"obs_mpvnhy9c_9585afe0fa44":{"concepts":["Error handling","React component initialization","Async data fetching"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Error message: \"Nu s-au putut încărca requirements pentru acest AI\"","Error location: src/components/react/ChallengeModal.tsx, line 59, column 15","Function: loadInitialData","Error