ent's accessibility and visual configuration, providing the necessary CSS data for further UI interaction or styling adjustments.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Probing \"Provoacă\" button attributes on current page","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:18:31.500Z","title":"UI Element Inspection via JavaScript Injection","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvnit01_52ba8912960f":{"concepts":["DOM manipulation","Browser automation","Authentication gating"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Successfully located and clicked 'Provoac' button via DOM selector.","Identified modal class '.scoru-modal' upon interaction.","Target requires authentication to initiate duel, confirming protected state."],"files":[],"id":"obs_mpvnit01_52ba8912960f","importance":5,"narrative":"The agent executed a DOM interaction script to test the interaction flow for dueling. The output confirms that the action triggers a modal requiring user authentication, establishing the need for an auth flow or credential handling.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Triggering 'Provoac' button to verify authentication requirement","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:18:48.502Z","title":"Evaluate UI interaction on target platform","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvnj6hx_ec78b9d2f0e3":{"concepts":["session management","cookie-based authentication","APIContext"],"confidence":1,"facts":["SESSION_KEY is defined as \"user_session\"","getUserSession retrieves the session value via context.cookies.get(SESSION_KEY)","Cookie management uses the Astro/framework context pattern (cookies.set/get/delete)","Session ID generation involves Date.now and Math.random"],"files":["src/lib/auth.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvnj6hx_ec78b9d2f0e3","importance":4,"narrative":"Inspected src/lib/auth.ts to understand how user sessions are persisted and retrieved. Confirmed that sessions are handled through standard cookie operations and identified the specific key and accessor functions used across the authentication flow.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Grepping session-related keys and cookie operations","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:19:05.993Z","title":"Inspect session management implementation in src/lib/auth.ts","type":"search"},"obs_mpvnjj3x_af83096f365c":{"concepts":["browser automation","cookie injection","session management"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Injected user_session cookie: br4d7t929128xzzvb08f0zxt","Targeted URL path: /meciuri/colombia-vs-costa-rica-2026-06-01","Environment identified existing g_state cookie"],"files":[],"id":"obs_mpvnjj3x_af83096f365c","importance":6,"narrative":"The agent attempted to bypass authentication or state requirements by manually setting a session cookie in the browser context. It subsequently navigated to a specific match page to retrieve content, confirming the cookie was successfully persisted.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Simulating authenticated user access to match data","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:19:22.334Z","title":"Inject session cookie and navigate to match page","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvnjqy2_0097b5a34561":{"concepts":["DOM scraping","Browser automation","Async JavaScript","Dynamic UI interaction"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Executed asynchronous JS snippet to locate and click 'Provoac' button","Targeted element identified by text content regex match","Extracted text from '.scoru-modal' class after 3.9s total delay","Retrieved betting data for Colombia vs Costa Rica duel"],"files":[],"id":"obs_mpvnjqy2_0097b5a34561","importance":5,"narrative":"The agent successfully automated a DOM interaction to retrieve betting odds/duel information from a dynamic modal. The script handled the latency of the UI by implementing explicit wait times before querying the modal content.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Scraping 'Provoac' modal content from target server","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:19:32.493Z","title":"Extracted duel betting data via browser automation","type":"subagent"},"obs_mpvnjusb_fe8db711fd63":{"concepts":["visual regression testing","remote UI inspection"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Tool: mcp__Claude_Preview__preview_screenshot","Output format: Base64 JPEG"],"files":[],"id":"obs_mpvnjusb_fe8db711fd63","importance":4,"narrative":"The agent captured a visual snapshot of the current environment state for server 8d649527. This is used to verify UI rendering or check for visual regressions in the running application.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Server ID: 8d649527-49e9-494f-b9e7-39dfad7f6b82","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:19:37.473Z","title":"Screenshot capture of server state","type":"file_read"},"obs_mpvnkk8z_73e5939e05fa":{"concepts":["DOM automation","async browser scripting","web interface interaction"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Executed async automation script to navigate modal betting workflow.","Automated selections: Oaspete (1X2), 1-1 (Score), Over 2.5 (O/U), DA (BTTS), Oaspete (First Scorer).","Resultant modal state captured: Duel vs Owl Alpha configured with 10000 crystals wager."],"files":[],"id":"obs_mpvnkk8z_73e5939e05fa","importance":5,"narrative":"The agent used a DOM-manipulation script to programmatically fill out a betting modal on the target web interface. By chaining clicks and sleep intervals, it navigated through five specific selection steps to reach the final confirmation state.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Interaction with scoru-modal UI elements","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:20:10.471Z","title":"Automated betting flow execution","type":"subagent"},"obs_mpvnlaee_a848ecf4a1ef":{"hookType":"post_tool_use","id":"obs_mpvnlaee_a848ecf4a1ef","raw":{"tool_input":{"file_path":"/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/api/ai/comprehensive-predictions.ts","limit":12,"offset":379},"tool_name":"Read","tool_output":{"file":{"content":"      const comprehensiveResponse: ComprehensiveAIPredictionResponse = {\n        id: savedPrediction.id,\n        predictions: aiPredictions,\n        model: aiModel.modelName,\n        modelId: aiModel.modelId,\n        aiUser: aiUser.name,\n        processingTime: processingTime,\n        createdAt: savedPrediction.createdAt.toISOString(),\n      };\n\n      return new Response(\n        JSON.stringify({","filePath":"/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/api/ai/comprehensive-predictions.ts","numLines":12,"startLine":379,"totalLines":521},"type":"text"}},"sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:20:44.362Z","toolInput":{"file_path":"/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/api/ai/comprehensive-predictions.ts","limit":12,"offset":379},"toolName":"Read","toolOutput":{"file":{"content":"      const comprehensiveResponse: ComprehensiveAIPredictionResponse = {\n        id: savedPrediction.id,\n        predictions: aiPredictions,\n        model: aiModel.modelName,\n        modelId: aiModel.modelId,\n        aiUser: aiUser.name,\n        processingTime: processingTime,\n        createdAt: savedPrediction.createdAt.toISOString(),\n      };\n\n      return new Response(\n        JSON.stringify({","filePath":"/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/api/ai/comprehensive-predictions.ts","numLines":12,"startLine":379,"totalLines":521},"type":"text"}},"obs_mpvnlf4x_5d3c78dcde8e":{"hookType":"post_tool_use","id":"obs_mpvnlf4x_5d3c78dcde8e","raw":{"tool_input":{"file_path":"/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/api/ai/comprehensive-predictions.ts","new_string":"        model: aiModel.modelName,\n        modelId: aiModel.modelId,\n        aiUser: aiUser.name,\n        aiUserId: aiUser.id,\n        processingTime: processingTime,\n        createdAt: savedPrediction.createdAt.toISOString(),\n      };","old_string":"        model: aiModel.modelName,\n        modelId: aiModel.modelId,\n        aiUser: aiUser.name,\n        processingTime: processingTime,\n        createdAt: savedPrediction.createdAt.toISOString(),\n      };","replace_all":false},"tool_name":"Edit","tool_output":"{\"filePath\":\"/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/api/ai/comprehensive-predictions.ts\",\"oldString\":\"        model: aiModel.modelName,\\n        modelId: aiModel.modelId,\\n        aiUser: aiUser.name,\\n        processingTime: processingTime,\\n        createdAt: savedPrediction.createdAt.toISOString(),\\n      };\",\"newString\":\"        model: aiModel.modelName,\\n        modelId: aiModel.modelId,\\n        aiUser: aiUser.name,\\n        aiUserId: aiUser.id,\\n        processingTime: processingTime,\\n        createdAt: savedPrediction.createdAt.toISOString(),\\n      };\",\"originalFile\":\"import type { APIRoute } from \\\"astro\\\";\\nimport { ChatOpenAI } from \\\"@langchain/openai\\\";\\nimport { SystemMessage, HumanMessage } from \\\"@langchain/core/messages\\\";\\nimport { drizzle } from \\\"drizzle-orm/postgres-js\\\";\\nimport postgres from \\\"postgres\\\";\\nimport { eq, and } from \\\"drizzle-orm\\\";\\nimport { createId } from \\\"@paralleldrive/cuid2\\\";\\nimport {\\n  matchesTable,\\n  teamsTable,\\n  authUsers,\\n  authAiModels,\\n  aiComprehensivePredictionsTable,\\n} from \\\"../../../db/schema\\\";\\nimport type {\\n  CreateAIPredictionRequest,\\n  ComprehensiveAIPrediction,\\n  ComprehensiveAIPredictionResponse,\\n} from \\\"../../../lib/types/ai-predictions\\\";\\n\\n// Interface pentru request body\\ninterface ComprehensivePredictionRequest extends CreateAIPredictionRequest {\\n  comprehensive: true;\\n}\\n\\n// Interface pentru răspunsul AI comprehensive\\ninterface AIComprehensivePredictionResponse {\\n  final_result: {\\n    prediction: \\\"1\\\" | \\\"X\\\" | \\\"2\\\";\\n    confidence: number;\\n    reasoning: string;\\n  };\\n  exact_score: {\\n    homeScore: number;\\n    awayScore: number;\\n    confidence: number;\\n    reasoning: string;\\n  };\\n  over_under_goals: {\\n    line: number;\\n    prediction: \\\"over\\\" | \\\"under\\\";\\n    confidence: number;\\n    reasoning: string;\\n  };\\n  both_teams_score: {\\n    prediction: \\\"yes\\\" | \\\"no\\\";\\n    confidence: number;\\n    reasoning: string;\\n  };\\n  first_goalscorer: {\\n    team: \\\"home\\\" | \\\"away\\\" | \\\"none\\\";\\n    confidence: number;\\n    reasoning: string;\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport const POST: APIRoute = async ({ request }) => {\\n  try {\\n    // Verifică environment variables\\n    const OPENROUTER_[REDACTED_SECRET];\\n    const DATABASE_URL = import.meta.env.DATABASE_URL;\\n\\n    if (!OPENROUTER_API_KEY) {\\n      return new Response(\\n        JSON.stringify({\\n          error: \\\"OPENROUTER_API_KEY nu este configurat\\\",\\n          code: \\\"MISSING_API_KEY\\\",\\n        }),\\n        { status: 500, headers: { \\\"Content-Type\\\": \\\"application/json\\\" } }\\n      );\\n    }\\n\\n    if (!DATABASE_URL) {\\n      return new Response(\\n        JSON.stringify({\\n          error: \\\"DATABASE_URL nu este configurat\\\",\\n          code: \\\"MISSING_DATABASE\\\",\\n        }),\\n        { status: 500, headers: { \\\"Content-Type\\\": \\\"application/json\\\" } }\\n      );\\n    }\\n\\n    // Parse request body\\n    const body: ComprehensivePredictionRequest = await request.json();\\n    const { matchId, aiUserId } = body;\\n\\n    if (!matchId) {\\n      return new Response(\\n        JSON.stringify({\\n          error: \\\"matchId este necesar\\\",\\n          code: \\\"MISSING_MATCH_ID\\\",\\n        }),\\n        { status: 400, headers: { \\\"Content-Type\\\": \\\"application/json\\\" } }\\n      );\\n    }\\n\\n    // Conectează la baza de date\\n    const pgClient = postgres(DATABASE_URL);\\n    const db = drizzle(pgClient);\\n\\n    try {\\n      // 1. Obține detaliile meciului\\n      const [match] = await db\\n        .select()\\n        .from(matchesTable)\\n        .where(eq(matchesTable.id, matchId));\\n\\n      if (!match) {\\n        return new Response(\\n          JSON.stringify({\\n            error: \\\"Meciul nu a fost găsit\\\",\\n            code: \\\"MATCH_NOT_FOUND\\\",\\n          }),\\n          { status: 404, headers: { \\\"Content-Type\\\": \\\"application/json\\\" } }\\n        );\\n      }\\n\\n      // Obține echipele separat\\n      const [homeTeam] = await db\\n        .select()\\n        .from(teamsTable)\\n        .where(eq(teamsTable.id, match.homeTeamId));\\n\\n      const [awayTeam] = await db\\n        .select()\\n        .from(teamsTable)\\n        .where(eq(teamsTable.id, match.awayTeamId));\\n\\n      const matchData = {\\n        match,\\n        homeTeam,\\n        awayTeam,\\n      };\\n\\n      // 2. Găsește utilizatorul AI și configurația modelului\\n      let aiUser;\\n      let aiModel;\\n\\n      if (aiUserId) {\\n        // Folosește AI-ul specificat\\n        [aiUser] = await db\\n          .select()\\n          .from(authUsers)\\n          .where(\\n            and(eq(authUsers.id, aiUserId), eq(authUsers.userType, \\\"ai\\\"))\\n          );\\n      } else {\\n        // Folosește primul AI disponibil\\n        [aiUser] = await db\\n          .select()\\n          .from(authUsers)\\n          .where(eq(authUsers.userType, \\\"ai\\\"))\\n          .limit(1);\\n      }\\n\\n      if (!aiUser) {\\n        return new Response(\\n          JSON.stringify({\\n            error: \\\"Utilizator AI nu a fost găsit\\\",\\n            code: \\\"AI_USER_NOT_FOUND\\\",\\n          }),\\n          { status: 404, headers: { \\\"Content-Type\\\": \\\"application/json\\\" } }\\n        );\\n      }\\n\\n      // Obține configurația modelului AI\\n      [aiModel] = await db\\n        .select()\\n        .from(authAiModels)\\n        .where(eq(authAiModels.userId, aiUser.id));\\n\\n      if (!aiModel) {\\n        return new Response(\\n          JSON.stringify({\\n            error: \\\"Configurația modelului AI nu a fost găsită\\\",\\n            code: \\\"AI_MODEL_NOT_FOUND\\\",\\n          }),\\n          { status: 404, headers: { \\\"Content-Type\\\": \\\"application/json\\\" } }\\n        );\\n      }\\n\\n      // 3. Pentru predicții comprehensive, generez un nou ID unic pentru fiecare request\\n      // (pentru a permite multiple seturi de predicții comprehensive)\\n\\n      // 4. Configurează LangChain cu OpenRouter\\n      const llm = new ChatOpenAI({\\n        modelName: aiModel.modelId,\\n        openAIApiKey: OPENROUTER_API_KEY,\\n        configuration: {\\n          baseURL: \\\"https://openrouter.ai/api/v1\\\",\\n          defaultHeaders: {\\n            \\\"HTTP-Referer\\\": \\\"https://scoru.ai\\\",\\n            \\\"X-Title\\\": \\\"SCORU - Sports Predictions\\\",\\n          },\\n        },\\n        temperature: 0.7,\\n        maxTokens: 2000, // Mai multe tokeni pentru predicții comprehensive\\n      });\\n\\n      // 5. Creează prompt-ul comprehensive pentru toate tipurile de predicții\\n      const systemPrompt = `Ești un expert în analiză sportivă și predicții de fotbal cu experiență vastă în toate tipurile de predicții sportive.\\nAnalizează meciul și oferă predicții complete pentru TOATE tipurile de pariuri disponibile.\\n\\nRăspunde DOAR în format JSON valid cu următoarea structură exactă:\\n{\\n  \\\"final_result\\\": {\\n    \\\"prediction\\\": \\\"1|X|2\\\",\\n    \\\"confidence\\\": număr_întreg_între_1_și_100,\\n    \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"explicația_predicției_în_română\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"exact_score\\\": {\\n    \\\"homeScore\\\": număr_întreg,\\n    \\\"awayScore\\\": număr_întreg,\\n    \\\"confidence\\\": număr_întreg_între_1_și_100,\\n    \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"explicația_predicției_în_română\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"over_under_goals\\\": {\\n    \\\"line\\\": număr_decimal_2.5,\\n    \\\"prediction\\\": \\\"over|under\\\",\\n    \\\"confidence\\\": număr_întreg_între_1_și_100,\\n    \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"explicația_predicției_în_română\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"both_teams_score\\\": {\\n    \\\"prediction\\\": \\\"yes|no\\\",\\n    \\\"confidence\\\": număr_întreg_între_1_și_100,\\n    \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"explicația_predicției_în_română\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"first_goalscorer\\\": {\\n    \\\"team\\\": \\\"home|away|none\\\",\\n    \\\"confidence\\\": număr_întreg_între_1_și_100,\\n    \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"explicația_predicției_în_română\\\"\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nIMPORTANTE:\\n- final_result: \\\"1\\\"=victoria gazdă, \\\"X\\\"=egalitate, \\\"2\\\"=victoria oaspeților\\n- exact_score: scorul exact pe care îl prezici\\n- over_under_goals: alege linia 2.5 și prezice over/under\\n- both_teams_score: \\\"yes\\\" dacă ambele echipe vor marca, \\\"no\\\" altfel\\n- first_goalscorer: \\\"home\\\" dacă gazda marchează primul, \\\"away\\\" ...[truncated]"},"sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:20:50.500Z","toolInput":{"file_path":"/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/api/ai/comprehensive-predictions.ts","new_string":"        model: aiModel.modelName,\n        modelId: aiModel.modelId,\n        aiUser: aiUser.name,\n        aiUserId: aiUser.id,\n        processingTime: processingTime,\n        createdAt: savedPrediction.createdAt.toISOString(),\n      };","old_string":"        model: aiModel.modelName,\n        modelId: aiModel.modelId,\n        aiUser: aiUser.name,\n        processingTime: processingTime,\n        createdAt: savedPrediction.createdAt.toISOString(),\n      };","replace_all":false},"toolName":"Edit","toolOutput":"{\"filePath\":\"/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/api/ai/comprehensive-predictions.ts\",\"oldString\":\"        model: aiModel.modelName,\\n        modelId: aiModel.modelId,\\n        aiUser: aiUser.name,\\n        processingTime: processingTime,\\n        createdAt: savedPrediction.createdAt.toISOString(),\\n      };\",\"newString\":\"        model: aiModel.modelName,\\n        modelId: aiModel.modelId,\\n        aiUser: aiUser.name,\\n        aiUserId: aiUser.id,\\n        processingTime: processingTime,\\n        createdAt: savedPrediction.createdAt.toISOString(),\\n      };\",\"originalFile\":\"import type { APIRoute } from \\\"astro\\\";\\nimport { ChatOpenAI } from \\\"@langchain/openai\\\";\\nimport { SystemMessage, HumanMessage } from \\\"@langchain/core/messages\\\";\\nimport { drizzle } from \\\"drizzle-orm/postgres-js\\\";\\nimport postgres from \\\"postgres\\\";\\nimport { eq, and } from \\\"drizzle-orm\\\";\\nimport { createId } from \\\"@paralleldrive/cuid2\\\";\\nimport {\\n  matchesTable,\\n  teamsTable,\\n  authUsers,\\n  authAiModels,\\n  aiComprehensivePredictionsTable,\\n} from \\\"../../../db/schema\\\";\\nimport type {\\n  CreateAIPredictionRequest,\\n  ComprehensiveAIPrediction,\\n  ComprehensiveAIPredictionResponse,\\n} from \\\"../../../lib/types/ai-predictions\\\";\\n\\n// Interface pentru request body\\ninterface ComprehensivePredictionRequest extends CreateAIPredictionRequest {\\n  comprehensive: true;\\n}\\n\\n// Interface pentru răspunsul AI comprehensive\\ninterface AIComprehensivePredictionResponse {\\n  final_result: {\\n    prediction: \\\"1\\\" | \\\"X\\\" | \\\"2\\\";\\n    confidence: number;\\n    reasoning: string;\\n  };\\n  exact_score: {\\n    homeScore: number;\\n    awayScore: number;\\n    confidence: number;\\n    reasoning: string;\\n  };\\n  over_under_goals: {\\n    line: number;\\n    prediction: \\\"over\\\" | \\\"under\\\";\\n    confidence: number;\\n    reasoning: string;\\n  };\\n  both_teams_score: {\\n    prediction: \\\"yes\\\" | \\\"no\\\";\\n    confidence: number;\\n    reasoning: string;\\n  };\\n  first_goalscorer: {\\n    team: \\\"home\\\" | \\\"away\\\" | \\\"none\\\";\\n    confidence: number;\\n    reasoning: string;\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport const POST: APIRoute = async ({ request }) => {\\n  try {\\n    // Verifică environment variables\\n    const OPENROUTER_[REDACTED_SECRET];\\n    const DATABASE_URL = import.meta.env.DATABASE_URL;\\n\\n    if (!OPENROUTER_API_KEY) {\\n      return new Response(\\n        JSON.stringify({\\n          error: \\\"OPENROUTER_API_KEY nu este configurat\\\",\\n          code: \\\"MISSING_API_KEY\\\",\\n        }),\\n        { status: 500, headers: { \\\"Content-Type\\\": \\\"application/json\\\" } }\\n      );\\n    }\\n\\n    if (!DATABASE_URL) {\\n      return new Response(\\n        JSON.stringify({\\n          error: \\\"DATABASE_URL nu este configurat\\\",\\n          code: \\\"MISSING_DATABASE\\\",\\n        }),\\n        { status: 500, headers: { \\\"Content-Type\\\": \\\"application/json\\\" } }\\n      );\\n    }\\n\\n    // Parse request body\\n    const body: ComprehensivePredictionRequest = await request.json();\\n    const { matchId, aiUserId } = body;\\n\\n    if (!matchId) {\\n      return new Response(\\n        JSON.stringify({\\n          error: \\\"matchId este necesar\\\",\\n          code: \\\"MISSING_MATCH_ID\\\",\\n        }),\\n        { status: 400, headers: { \\\"Content-Type\\\": \\\"application/json\\\" } }\\n      );\\n    }\\n\\n    // Conectează la baza de date\\n    const pgClient = postgres(DATABASE_URL);\\n    const db = drizzle(pgClient);\\n\\n    try {\\n      // 1. Obține detaliile meciului\\n      const [match] = await db\\n        .select()\\n        .from(matchesTable)\\n        .where(eq(matchesTable.id, matchId));\\n\\n      if (!match) {\\n        return new Response(\\n          JSON.stringify({\\n            error: \\\"Meciul nu a fost găsit\\\",\\n            code: \\\"MATCH_NOT_FOUND\\\",\\n          }),\\n          { status: 404, headers: { \\\"Content-Type\\\": \\\"application/json\\\" } }\\n        );\\n      }\\n\\n      // Obține echipele separat\\n      const [homeTeam] = await db\\n        .select()\\n        .from(teamsTable)\\n        .where(eq(teamsTable.id, match.homeTeamId));\\n\\n      const [awayTeam] = await db\\n        .select()\\n        .from(teamsTable)\\n        .where(eq(teamsTable.id, match.awayTeamId));\\n\\n      const matchData = {\\n        match,\\n        homeTeam,\\n        awayTeam,\\n      };\\n\\n      // 2. Găsește utilizatorul AI și configurația modelului\\n      let aiUser;\\n      let aiModel;\\n\\n      if (aiUserId) {\\n        // Folosește AI-ul specificat\\n        [aiUser] = await db\\n          .select()\\n          .from(authUsers)\\n          .where(\\n            and(eq(authUsers.id, aiUserId), eq(authUsers.userType, \\\"ai\\\"))\\n          );\\n      } else {\\n        // Folosește primul AI disponibil\\n        [aiUser] = await db\\n          .select()\\n          .from(authUsers)\\n          .where(eq(authUsers.userType, \\\"ai\\\"))\\n          .limit(1);\\n      }\\n\\n      if (!aiUser) {\\n        return new Response(\\n          JSON.stringify({\\n            error: \\\"Utilizator AI nu a fost găsit\\\",\\n            code: \\\"AI_USER_NOT_FOUND\\\",\\n          }),\\n          { status: 404, headers: { \\\"Content-Type\\\": \\\"application/json\\\" } }\\n        );\\n      }\\n\\n      // Obține configurația modelului AI\\n      [aiModel] = await db\\n        .select()\\n        .from(authAiModels)\\n        .where(eq(authAiModels.userId, aiUser.id));\\n\\n      if (!aiModel) {\\n        return new Response(\\n          JSON.stringify({\\n            error: \\\"Configurația modelului AI nu a fost găsită\\\",\\n            code: \\\"AI_MODEL_NOT_FOUND\\\",\\n          }),\\n          { status: 404, headers: { \\\"Content-Type\\\": \\\"application/json\\\" } }\\n        );\\n      }\\n\\n      // 3. Pentru predicții comprehensive, generez un nou ID unic pentru fiecare request\\n      // (pentru a permite multiple seturi de predicții comprehensive)\\n\\n      // 4. Configurează LangChain cu OpenRouter\\n      const llm = new ChatOpenAI({\\n        modelName: aiModel.modelId,\\n        openAIApiKey: OPENROUTER_API_KEY,\\n        configuration: {\\n          baseURL: \\\"https://openrouter.ai/api/v1\\\",\\n          defaultHeaders: {\\n            \\\"HTTP-Referer\\\": \\\"https://scoru.ai\\\",\\n            \\\"X-Title\\\": \\\"SCORU - Sports Predictions\\\",\\n          },\\n        },\\n        temperature: 0.7,\\n        maxTokens: 2000, // Mai multe tokeni pentru predicții comprehensive\\n      });\\n\\n      // 5. Creează prompt-ul comprehensive pentru toate tipurile de predicții\\n      const systemPrompt = `Ești un expert în analiză sportivă și predicții de fotbal cu experiență vastă în toate tipurile de predicții sportive.\\nAnalizează meciul și oferă predicții complete pentru TOATE tipurile de pariuri disponibile.\\n\\nRăspunde DOAR în format JSON valid cu următoarea structură exactă:\\n{\\n  \\\"final_result\\\": {\\n    \\\"prediction\\\": \\\"1|X|2\\\",\\n    \\\"confidence\\\": număr_întreg_între_1_și_100,\\n    \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"explicația_predicției_în_română\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"exact_score\\\": {\\n    \\\"homeScore\\\": număr_întreg,\\n    \\\"awayScore\\\": număr_întreg,\\n    \\\"confidence\\\": număr_întreg_între_1_și_100,\\n    \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"explicația_predicției_în_română\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"over_under_goals\\\": {\\n    \\\"line\\\": număr_decimal_2.5,\\n    \\\"prediction\\\": \\\"over|under\\\",\\n    \\\"confidence\\\": număr_întreg_între_1_și_100,\\n    \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"explicația_predicției_în_română\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"both_teams_score\\\": {\\n    \\\"prediction\\\": \\\"yes|no\\\",\\n    \\\"confidence\\\": număr_întreg_între_1_și_100,\\n    \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"explicația_predicției_în_română\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"first_goalscorer\\\": {\\n    \\\"team\\\": \\\"home|away|none\\\",\\n    \\\"confidence\\\": număr_întreg_între_1_și_100,\\n    \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"explicația_predicției_în_română\\\"\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nIMPORTANTE:\\n- final_result: \\\"1\\\"=victoria gazdă, \\\"X\\\"=egalitate, \\\"2\\\"=victoria oaspeților\\n- exact_score: scorul exact pe care îl prezici\\n- over_under_goals: alege linia 2.5 și prezice over/under\\n- both_teams_score: \\\"yes\\\" dacă ambele echipe vor marca, \\\"no\\\" altfel\\n- first_goalscorer: \\\"home\\\" dacă gazda marchează primul, \\\"away\\\" ...[truncated]"},"obs_mpvnlmxt_647802b952e2":{"hookType":"post_tool_use","id":"obs_mpvnlmxt_647802b952e2","raw":{"tool_input":{"expression":"(() => { document.cookie = \"user_session=; path=/; expires=Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:00 GMT\"; const m=document.querySelector('.scoru-modal'); return { clearedCookie: !document.cookie.includes('user_session=br4d'), modalStillOpen: !!m }; })()","serverId":"8d649527-49e9-494f-b9e7-39dfad7f6b82"},"tool_name":"mcp__Claude_Preview__preview_eval","tool_output":[{"text":"{\n  \"clearedCookie\": true,\n  \"modalStillOpen\": false\n}","type":"text"}]},"sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:21:00.613Z","toolInput":{"expression":"(() => { document.cookie = \"user_session=; path=/; expires=Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:00 GMT\"; const m=document.querySelector('.scoru-modal'); return { clearedCookie: !document.cookie.includes('user_session=br4d'), modalStillOpen: !!m }; })()","serverId":"8d649527-49e9-494f-b9e7-39dfad7f6b82"},"toolName":"mcp__Claude_Preview__preview_eval","toolOutput":[{"text":"{\n  \"clearedCookie\": true,\n  \"modalStillOpen\": false\n}","type":"text"}]},"obs_mpvnlsub_f137917e0c78":{"concepts":["refactoring","git status","code migration"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Deleted legacy AI prediction components and API routes","Modified core UI components (NavBar, Footer, AuthButtons) and database schema","scripts/ai directory contains generate-comprehensive.ts, models.ts, and seed-models.ts","Significant changes in package dependencies and match-related logic"],"files":["scripts/ai/","src/components/react/ComprehensiveAIPredictions.tsx","src/db/schema/predictions.ts","src/pages/api/ai/comprehensive-predictions.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvnlsub_f137917e0c78","importance":5,"narrative":"The environment check confirms the migration from legacy prediction components to the new comprehensive AI prediction system. Several files were deleted or updated, indicating a refactor of the match prediction architecture and UI.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Checking git status and listing AI scripts","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:21:08.263Z","title":"Review workspace state and script directory","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvod4gd_c58db40520b0":{"concepts":["UX flow optimization","React performance optimization","Input validation","State management"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Stake selection must be the first step in the duel creation process.","The stake selection slider is currently experiencing performance issues (frame dropping/stuttering).","Error message \"Meciul a început deja\" occurs prematurely during dialog initialization."],"files":["src/components/DuelCreation.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpvod4gd_c58db40520b0","importance":6,"narrative":"The user identified a UX flaw where the stake selection step is buried behind a dialog, causing performance issues with the slider component. I need to prioritize the stake input, move it outside the blocking dialog, and ensure the match-start validation check is handled gracefully.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Refactoring stake selection and error handling","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:42:23.006Z","title":"Reorder duel creation flow and fix UI stutter","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvoewbz_8488e088cc55":{"concepts":["UI/UX flow","State-driven UI","React component configuration"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["The 'bet' object was moved from index 5 to index 0 in the STEPS array.","This change prioritizes the \"Miza\" (betting) step in the ChallengeModal UI component."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/react/ChallengeModal.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpvoewbz_8488e088cc55","importance":4,"narrative":"The order of questions in the ChallengeModal interaction flow was updated to prompt the user for their bet amount first. This ensures users establish their stake before proceeding to specific match prediction questions.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Moved 'bet' step to the beginning of the interaction flow","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:43:45.810Z","title":"Reorder STEPS array in ChallengeModal","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvof2mc_a41ea51b281c":{"concepts":["TypeScript interfaces","React component props","Conditional UI state"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Added matchStarted?: boolean to ChallengeModalProps interface.","Documented purpose: to prevent duels if the match has already started."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/react/ChallengeModal.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpvof2mc_a41ea51b281c","importance":4,"narrative":"Updated the ChallengeModal component props to include a matchStarted flag. This change allows the UI to conditionally disable challenging capabilities based on the real-time status of a match.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Added matchStarted property to ChallengeModalProps","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:43:53.959Z","title":"Update ChallengeModalProps interface","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvof6ef_cf00e63fac73":{"concepts":["React component props","Component interface"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Added matchStarted prop to the ChallengeModal function component arguments","Set default value for matchStarted to false"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/react/ChallengeModal.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpvof6ef_cf00e63fac73","importance":4,"narrative":"Updated the ChallengeModal component signature to accept the matchStarted prop. This allows the component to receive and use the state indicating whether a match has already commenced, preventing invalid challenges in live games.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Adding matchStarted to ChallengeModal signature","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:43:58.861Z","title":"Update ChallengeModal component props","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvofpzg_b9163ffb29c8":{"concepts":["React component refactoring","Inline functional components","Conditional rendering pattern"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Moved BetStep component logic directly into the 'bet' case of the ChallengeModal switch statement.","Removed the standalone BetStep function definition.","Preserved all betting UI functionality including range input, chip selection, and payout summary."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/react/ChallengeModal.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpvofpzg_b9163ffb29c8","importance":4,"narrative":"Refactored the ChallengeModal to inline the BetStep component, simplifying the component structure by removing a nested function declaration. This improves code locality and reduces the component hierarchy for the 'bet' modal state.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Refactored ChallengeModal.tsx to remove redundant component definition","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:44:24.234Z","title":"Inline BetStep component into ChallengeModal switch","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvog2or_02f23bc66184":{"concepts":["conditional rendering","React state handling","UX validation"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Added conditional rendering block to check matchStarted state before displaying content","Implemented a UI feedback component for users attempting to challenge AI on active matches","Component provides an 'Închide' (Close) button if the match has started"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/react/ChallengeModal.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpvog2or_02f23bc66184","importance":5,"narrative":"I updated ChallengeModal.tsx to prevent users from initiating duels after a match has started. By checking the matchStarted prop, the modal now displays a specific UI message notifying the user that duels are closed for active matches instead of showing the challenge form.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Handling forbidden duels when a match has already commenced","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:44:40.703Z","title":"Add 'matchStarted' state to ChallengeModal","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvog7zu_35a4228aca89":{"concepts":["conditional rendering","React component props","state management"],"confidence":1,"facts