eact component cleanup","prop drilling","TypeScript interfaces"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Removed onPredictClick property from ComprehensiveAIPredictions component props","Updated component function signature to remove unused prop"],"files":["src/components/react/ComprehensiveAIPredictions.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpvopb0t_b7aea86d4b8c","importance":4,"narrative":"Cleaned up the interface for ComprehensiveAIPredictions by removing the unused onPredictClick prop, which was no longer required in the component's implementation.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Cleaning up interface props","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:51:51.408Z","title":"Remove onPredictClick prop from ComprehensiveAIPredictions","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvopf9d_b70f4089de28":{"concepts":["React component mapping","prop drilling","React list keys"],"confidence":1,"facts":["File path: /Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/react/ComprehensiveAIPredictions.tsx","Inspected rendering logic for PredictionCard component list","Key generation uses prediction.id fallback to index","Props passed: prediction, index, locked, onPredictClick, onChallengeClick"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/react/ComprehensiveAIPredictions.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpvopf9d_b70f4089de28","importance":3,"narrative":"Read the render block of the ComprehensiveAIPredictions component to understand how PredictionCard is instantiated. This identifies the current interface for prediction-related callbacks and the keying strategy used for list rendering.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Examining prediction mapping and prop drilling","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:51:56.902Z","title":"Read PredictionCard implementation in ComprehensiveAIPredictions","type":"file_read"},"obs_mpvopoal_73758a6299b0":{"concepts":["React prop cleanup","component refactoring"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Removed onPredictClick prop from the prediction rendering loop in ComprehensiveAIPredictions.tsx","Retained onChallengeClick prop for the same components"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/react/ComprehensiveAIPredictions.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpvopoal_73758a6299b0","importance":4,"narrative":"Refactored the prediction display component to remove an unused onPredictClick event handler. This simplifies the component interface, keeping only the necessary challenge interaction logic.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Cleaning up unused prediction interaction handler","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:52:08.609Z","title":"Remove onPredictClick prop from prediction components","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvopw7t_a406a59233a2":{"concepts":["React state management","Optimistic UI","Custom events","Local storage persistence"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Component manages state for match prediction locking and optimistic UI updates.","Uses localStorage key 'scoru:predicted:${matchId}' to persist prediction state.","Listens for 'scoru:unlock-predictions' custom event to trigger UI state updates.","API endpoint for data fetching is '/api/ai/comprehensive-predictions'.","Locking logic relies on matchStatus and eventDate comparison."],"files":["src/components/react/ComprehensiveAIPredictionsWrapper.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpvopw7t_a406a59233a2","importance":3,"narrative":"The component handles the display logic for match predictions, distinguishing between locked and public states based on match lifecycle. It currently uses client-side localStorage to persist user prediction state, with a TODO to transition this to a server-side source of truth.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Analyzing prediction UI gating logic and local persistence","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:52:18.876Z","title":"Read ComprehensiveAIPredictionsWrapper component","type":"file_read"},"obs_mpvoq2mu_2f1b7356d31f":{"concepts":["React component props","TypeScript interfaces","Component state management"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Added userHasPredicted?: boolean to ComprehensiveAIPredictionsWrapperProps","Added userHasPredicted = false as a default parameter to the component signature"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/react/ComprehensiveAIPredictionsWrapper.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpvoq2mu_2f1b7356d31f","importance":4,"narrative":"Updated the wrapper component to accept a server-provided prediction status. This allows the component to receive external validation of whether a user has already locked a prediction for a match, moving away from local-only state.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Added userHasPredicted prop to interface","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:52:27.191Z","title":"Update ComprehensiveAIPredictionsWrapper props","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvoq7bg_2395d09b7510":{"concepts":["React state management","prop-drilling","client-side state synchronization"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Replaced local optimistic state initialization with userHasPredicted prop.","Removed reliance on localStorage for prediction status to prevent false unlock states.","Retained event-based local flip for duel creation, allowing session-specific updates."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/react/ComprehensiveAIPredictionsWrapper.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpvoq7bg_2395d09b7510","importance":5,"narrative":"The component's prediction state was previously managed by an optimistic flag stored in localStorage, which caused bugs with persistent false unlocks. By switching to the server-provided userHasPredicted boolean, the initial state is now accurately synced with the database.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Replacing localStorage optimistic flag with userHasPredicted prop","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:52:33.264Z","title":"Refactor prediction state to use server-provided truth","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvoqdn8_78ef595e32b1":{"concepts":["React useEffect","State management","Client-side persistence removal"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Removed localStorage check for 'scoru:predicted' key inside useEffect","Added userHasPredicted to useEffect dependency array","Initialized predicted state directly from userHasPredicted prop"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/react/ComprehensiveAIPredictionsWrapper.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpvoqdn8_78ef595e32b1","importance":5,"narrative":"The component was updated to rely strictly on the userHasPredicted prop rather than client-side localStorage. This change addresses synchronization issues where localStorage caused stale or false prediction states for matches.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Transition to prop-based prediction state management","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:52:41.466Z","title":"Remove localStorage reliance for prediction unlock state","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvoqiw0_894186f053e2":{"concepts":["state management","event-driven architecture","deprecated code cleanup"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Removed the handlePredictClick function which utilized localStorage for optimistic UI updates.","The application now relies on server-side state (userHasPredicted) and event-driven updates (scoru:unlock-predictions) for state synchronization.","Eliminated potential for stale localStorage data affecting prediction visibility."],"files":["src/components/react/ComprehensiveAIPredictionsWrapper.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpvoqiw0_894186f053e2","importance":4,"narrative":"The handlePredictClick function was removed to deprecate client-side localStorage caching for match predictions. By moving entirely to server-sourced state and custom DOM events, the component avoids UI inconsistencies caused by persisting \"unlocked\" states across sessions incorrectly.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Cleaning up deprecated prediction unlock logic","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:52:48.260Z","title":"Remove handlePredictClick from ComprehensiveAIPredictionsWrapper","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvoqmkd_2f59a44a5844":{"concepts":["React component refactoring","Prop cleanup"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Removed 'onPredictClick={handlePredictClick}' prop from ComprehensiveAIPredictions component usage.","The prop handlePredictClick was unused in the wrapper's current implementation."],"files":["src/components/react/ComprehensiveAIPredictionsWrapper.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpvoqmkd_2f59a44a5844","importance":3,"narrative":"Cleaned up the component props for ComprehensiveAIPredictions by removing an unnecessary click handler. This reduces component API surface area and clarifies the interaction model for the predictions wrapper.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Cleaning up unused callback in ComprehensiveAIPredictionsWrapper.tsx","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:52:53.024Z","title":"Remove onPredictClick prop from ComprehensiveAIPredictions component","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvoqtgz_d5e0aeba0ec5":{"concepts":["state management","localStorage cleanup","event-driven communication","single source of truth"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Removed localStorage.setItem usage for 'scoru:predicted:${matchId}'","Retained client-side 'scoru:unlock-predictions' custom event for UI updates","Shifted reliance to server truth (userHasPredicted) for persistent state across reloads"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/react/ChallengeModal.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpvoqtgz_d5e0aeba0ec5","importance":4,"narrative":"The component was updated to stop persisting prediction state in localStorage, opting instead to rely on server-side state for persistent UI logic. The 'scoru:unlock-predictions' event remains to trigger immediate UI updates upon successful challenge creation, ensuring a consistent user experience during the active session.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Updated ChallengeModal.tsx to rely on server-side state","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:53:01.975Z","title":"Remove localStorage reliance for AI prediction revealing","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvor38x_03298bf01f57":