":["TypeScript","Static Analysis","React"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Tested files: ComprehensiveAIPredictions.tsx, ComprehensiveAIPredictionsWrapper.tsx, ChallengeModalWrapper.tsx","No type errors reported for the specified files","Used npx tsc with bundler module resolution and react-jsx target"],"files":["src/components/react/ComprehensiveAIPredictions.tsx","src/components/react/ComprehensiveAIPredictionsWrapper.tsx","src/components/react/ChallengeModalWrapper.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpvorn3u_221c1f9fe87b","importance":4,"narrative":"The agent performed an isolated type-check on three key React components to ensure current code changes did not introduce structural regressions. All files passed compilation successfully with no TypeScript errors reported.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Verified compilation status of three target files","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:53:40.383Z","title":"TypeScript isolation check for React components","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvoti6m_4006532e51ce":{"concepts":["data verification","UI feedback","prediction validation"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["User requested visual indicators for prediction accuracy.","System needs to compare AI-generated match predictions against final match results."],"files":["src/components/PredictionCard.tsx","src/services/predictionValidator.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvoti6m_4006532e51ce","importance":5,"narrative":"The user identified a missing feedback mechanism for AI predictions on match outcomes. We need to implement a logic layer to verify predictions against actual results and surface this status in the UI.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Feature request for sports match predictions","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:55:07.292Z","title":"Implement AI prediction accuracy tracking","type":"task"},"obs_mpvoudv8_b98198d03328":{"concepts":["TypeScript interfaces","Drizzle ORM","data normalization","sorting algorithms"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Normalized events are sorted by the 'minute' property.","Match event objects contain teamId, type, minute, scoreHome, and scoreAway.","getMatchDetails function queries sportsMatchEvents using Drizzle ORM syntax.","Interfaces include NormalizedEvent, EnhanceResult, and MatchDetailsRead."],"files":["src/lib/server/match-details.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvoudv8_b98198d03328","importance":3,"narrative":"Inspected the data schema for match events to understand how scores and team information are structured. This confirmed the field names and sorting order required for database queries and event processing.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Examine TypeScript interfaces and sorting logic in match-details.ts","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:55:48.380Z","title":"Inspect Match Events Data Structure","type":"file_read"},"obs_mpvovndb_5f36b162f3b1":{"concepts":["business logic","type-safe utility","prediction validation"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Created /src/lib/scoring.ts to handle prediction validation against MatchResult.","Defined ComprehensivePick and ComprehensiveVerdicts interfaces for multi-market predictions.","Implemented scoring logic for final result, exact score, over/under, BTTS, and first goalscorer.","Established MARKET_POINTS constant for duel/leaderboard weightings."],"files":["src/lib/scoring.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvovndb_5f36b162f3b1","importance":7,"narrative":"Implemented a centralized scoring utility to evaluate match predictions. This module handles both boolean verdict determination (correct/incorrect) and point aggregation, providing a unified interface for both prediction display and the upcoming duel resolution system.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Implemented prediction verification and point calculation","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:56:47.341Z","title":"Created scoring logic module","type":"file_write"},"obs_mpvovygu_1f6f8be7b210":{"concepts":["TypeScript types","React component imports","Scoring logic integration"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Imported scoreComprehensive, MatchResult, and Verdict from ../../lib/scoring","Target file: /Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/react/ComprehensiveAIPredictions.tsx"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/react/ComprehensiveAIPredictions.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpvovygu_1f6f8be7b210","importance":4,"narrative":"The component required access to core scoring logic and type definitions to implement predictions rendering. These imports were added to support the integration of existing scoring utilities into the AI prediction card component.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Adding scoreComprehensive, MatchResult, and Verdict imports","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:57:01.730Z","title":"Import scoring utilities in ComprehensiveAIPredictions","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvow32d_06d6e369160e":{"concepts":["TypeScript interfaces","React component props","Component state modeling"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Modified ComprehensiveAIPredictionsProps interface in ComprehensiveAIPredictions.tsx","Added optional result prop of type MatchResult | null","Enables verdict rendering (✓/✗) per market in the prediction card"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/react/ComprehensiveAIPredictions.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpvow32d_06d6e369160e","importance":4,"narrative":"I updated the ComprehensiveAIPredictions component interface to accept a result prop. This allows the component to display actual match outcome verdicts alongside predicted data, supporting the visual representation of successes and failures.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Adding result prop to interface","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:57:07.686Z","title":"Update ComprehensiveAIPredictions component props","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvowixg_2de840db24e5":{"concepts":["React functional components","Conditional rendering","CSS color-mix","UI state management"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Added VerdictBadge component to handle display of match outcomes (✓/✗/–).","Updated MarketRow to accept an optional verdict prop and conditional styling based on settlement state.","Replaced static confidence bar display with conditional rendering: showing verdict badge if settled, else showing confidence bar.","Dynamic colors for text and backgrounds implemented using CSS color-mix and design system variables."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/react/ComprehensiveAIPredictions.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpvowixg_2de840db24e5","importance":5,"narrative":"Enhanced the MarketRow component to support displaying final match outcomes by adding a verdict property. Created a dedicated VerdictBadge component to visually represent results, and refactored the row logic to toggle between confidence indicators and verdict badges depending on whether a market is settled.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Added match result indicators to MarketRow components","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:57:28.246Z","title":"Implement VerdictBadge and update MarketRow","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvowsas_029847d8cec9":{"concepts":["React component","UI data aggregation","CSS dynamic styling","TypeScript interfaces"],"confidence":1,"facts":["File: /Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/react/ComprehensiveAIPredictions.tsx","Lines 133-193 read","Calculates average confidence across 5 prediction categories","PredictionCard utilizes dynamic styling based on prediction confidence and AI user"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/react/ComprehensiveAIPredictions.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpvowsas_029847d8cec9","importance":3,"narrative":"Read the implementation of the PredictionCard component within the ComprehensiveAIPredictions file. Identified how the component aggregates confidence scores across multiple prediction metrics and renders UI elements like status dots and confidence bars.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Inspecting UI rendering logic for AI predictions","timest