e five prediction markets, allowing for UI feedback on correct vs incorrect predictions.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Adding result-based grading to ComprehensiveAIPredictions","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:57:59.374Z","title":"Integrate scoring logic into PredictionCard component","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvoxd3g_1449e19c64b1":{"concepts":["conditional rendering","React component patterns","UI state management","data-driven styling"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Added conditional rendering to ComprehensiveAIPredictions.tsx.","Implemented a verdict display showing \"{hits}/5 corecte\" when verdicts are present.","Verdict text color dynamically updates based on hits threshold (hits &gt;= 3).","Maintained \"încredere medie {avgConf}%\" fallback when no verdicts are available."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/react/ComprehensiveAIPredictions.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpvoxd3g_1449e19c64b1","importance":5,"narrative":"Modified the AI predictions component to differentiate between prediction confidence and actual post-match results. If score verdicts are available, the UI now displays the successful hit count with visual feedback (win color if &gt;= 3 hits), replacing the static average confidence display.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Conditional rendering of verdict stats","timestamp":"2026-06-01T20:58:07.343Z","title":"Update AI prediction UI for post-match scoring","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvoxm8h_d20efdbc5486":{"concepts":["Conditional UI rendering","React component patterns","Dynamic CSS variables"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Replaced static text color for prediction results with conditional styling based on 'verdicts' state (win/loss colors).","Introduced 'VerdictBadge' component for conditional rendering when results are available.","Maintained fallback confidence display logic for cases where no verdict is present."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/react/Comprehensiv