gic","timestamp":"2026-06-01T21:21:02.173Z","title":"Read server-side leaderboard aggregation logic","type":"file_read"},"obs_mpvprmau_243f6403ecb1":{"concepts":["Drizzle ORM","Code cleanup","TypeScript imports"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Removed 'and', 'desc', 'eq', 'gte', 'lte' from Drizzle ORM imports.","Removed imports for 'authUsers' and 'predLeaderboardEntries' schemas.","File path: /Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/lib/server/leaderboard.ts"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/lib/server/leaderboard.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvprmau_243f6403ecb1","importance":4,"narrative":"Cleaned up unused schema and operator imports in the leaderboard server file to reduce clutter and improve maintainability. The core Drizzle configuration and league logic remain untouched.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Removing unused Drizzle ORM helpers","timestamp":"2026-06-01T21:21:38.955Z","title":"Clean up unused imports in leaderboard.ts","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvps7m4_8851f8f48da2":{"concepts":["SQL aggregation","Database refactoring","Dynamic query generation","Time-series data processing"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Replaced reliance on `pred_leaderboard_entries` table with raw SQL queries against `pred_challenges`.","Implemented `aggregateDuels` helper to calculate points, wins, and accuracy on-the-fly.","Support for time-windowed leaderboards using `date_trunc` ('week' and 'month').","Filtered to human-only players and completed crystal-based challenges."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/lib/server/leaderboard.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvps7m4_8851f8f48da2","importance":8,"narrative":"The leaderboard implementation was refactored to query the source `pred_challenges` table directly rather than relying on a pre-computed `pred_leaderboard_entries` table. This provides real-time leaderboard data based on the source of truth, removing the overhead and potential drift of maintaining a separate aggregation table.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Replacing table-based lookups with dynamic `pred_challenges` querying","timestamp":"2026-06-01T21:22:06.574Z","title":"Migrate leaderboard logic from pre-aggregated table to live SQL aggregation","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvpshjo_6a7289ef1870":{"concepts":["PostgreSQL","Drizzle ORM","Raw SQL","Query Optimization"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Replaced Drizzle ORM query with raw Postgres SQL query.","Query logic now uses date_trunc('week', NOW()) instead of isoWeek helper.","The function continues to filter for 'human' user types.","Maintains signature export async function getActivePlayersCount(_at: Date = new Date())."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/lib/server/leaderboard.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvpshjo_6a7289ef1870","importance":5,"narrative":"Simplified the implementation of getActivePlayersCount in leaderboard.ts by switching to a raw SQL execution. This removes reliance on complex Drizzle ORM query builders for a simple count, opting for a standard Postgres window-based calculation.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Switching from Drizzle ORM to raw SQL for weekly player counting","timestamp":"2026-06-01T21:22:19.447Z","title":"Refactor getActivePlayersCount to raw SQL","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvpt6sk_4b8254555167":{"concepts":["TypeScript interface","SQL joins","data transformation","dashboard metrics"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Defined UserDuel TypeScript interface for type-safe duel data handling.","Implemented getUserDuels async function using raw SQL query joining pred_challenges, auth_users, sports_matches, and sports_teams.","Query logic includes manual status mapping to determine duel outcomes (won/lost/tie/pending)."],"files":["src/lib/server/duels.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvpt6sk_4b8254555167","importance":5,"narrative":"Added functionality to retrieve a user's duel history for the profile dashboard. The implementation includes a robust SQL join sequence to aggregate match results, AI opponent names, and