olumes were rejected as overkill or unnecessary complexity"],"files":["public/teams/"],"id":"obs_mpvugrad_23eb6329c86a","importance":7,"narrative":"The team evaluated three strategies for storing team logos: repository-based, persistent volumes, and object storage. We decided to store the images directly in the repository because the set changes rarely, the total size is manageable, and it removes the need for additional infrastructure configuration in Coolify.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Decided to store team logos in the repository","timestamp":"2026-06-01T23:33:10.257Z","title":"Logo storage strategy selection","type":"decision"},"obs_mpvuh9mj_5726958981ac":{"concepts":["Drizzle ORM","Schema auditing","Dependency mapping","Image processing"],"confidence":1,"facts":["sports_competitions table contains logo_url column but has 0 records with data (total: 39)","sharp image processing library is installed","Extensive usage of logoUrl across Astro components, React components, and API routes identified","sports_competitions and sports_teams both use logo_url mapped to logoUrl"],"files":["src/db/schema/sports.ts","src/components/ligi/StandingsTable.astro","src/components/react/meciuri/MatchCard.tsx","src/lib/server/teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvuh9mj_5726958981ac","importance":5,"narrative":"Analyzed the database schema and confirmed that while the sports_competitions table supports a logo_url, it is currently empty for all 39 records. Identified all downstream consumers of logo data to prepare for potential image processing or migration tasks. Confirmed that the 'sharp' library is available for future image transformation work.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Verified database schema, logo usage, and sharp availability","timestamp":"2026-06-01T23:33:34.046Z","title":"Audit schema and logo dependencies","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvuhtlv_fd4b6a7c4cfd":{"concepts":["Drizzle ORM","Upsert logic","Data persistence"],"confidence":1,"facts":["The code uses Drizzle ORM .update().set() patterns on lines 160-161 and 180-181","New inserts utilize .insert().values() for sportsTeams (line 340) and importEntityMappings (line 444)","LogoUrl is explicitly handled during insertion at line 346: `logoUrl: teamData.logoUrl || null`","Action types include \"created\", \"updated\", \"mapped\", and \"skipped\""],"files":["src/pages/api/data-assignment/assign-teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvuhtlv_fd4b6a7c4cfd","importance":4,"narrative":"Inspected existing Drizzle ORM operations within the team assignment API to identify how logoUrl updates are handled versus initial creation. The search confirms distinct handling for upsert logic and specific mapping entities, providing a baseline for implementing or fixing logo-related persistence.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Grepping Drizzle ORM update/insert patterns","timestamp":"2026-06-01T23:33:59.945Z","title":"Analyze assign-teams.ts logo and update logic","type":"file_read"},"obs_mpvuhw01_1b88e5d4d022":{"concepts":["Drizzle ORM","Entity Mapping","Database Insertion","Data Integrity"],"confidence":1,"facts":["createNewTeam generates team IDs using current timestamp and random alphanumeric string.","Inserts record into sports_teams table with auto-generated short name.","Calls createEntityMapping to link external source IDs to internal sports_teams records.","Uses Drizzle ORM (inferred) for database operations."],"files":["src/pages/api/data-assignment/assign-teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvuhw01_1b88e5d4d022","importance":4,"narrative":"The agent inspected the logic responsible for creating new teams within the assign-teams API endpoint. This process involves generating a unique internal ID, inserting the record into the sports_teams table, and establishing an entity mapping to track the origin of the data.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Examining data insertion and entity mapping patterns","times