ictive by enforcing a standard URL format. This prevented the application from using local file mirror paths (e.g., /teams/*.webp), so the .url() constraint was removed to allow flexible string inputs.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Updated logoUrl to accept local mirror paths","timestamp":"2026-06-01T23:41:30.939Z","title":"Relax logoUrl validation in playerWithTeamSchema","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvuroi6_d3b8b1a78e8a":{"concepts":["API testing","curl","JSON parsing","local development"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Endpoint /api/matches/by-date returned HTTP 200 for date 02.06.2026","homeTeam.logoUrl path returned as /teams/medium-enet-8258.webp"],"files":["/api/matches/by-date"],"id":"obs_mpvuroi6_d3b8b1a78e8a","importance":3,"narrative":"The agent verified the functionality of the matches by-date API endpoint. It confirmed that the service is active and correctly returning static paths for team logos, which is essential for frontend asset resolution.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Checking HTTP status and logoUrl data structure","timestamp":"2026-06-01T23:41:39.890Z","title":"Verification of matches/by-date API response","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvurtzu_8c43983981b6":{"concepts":["static asset server","HTTP diagnostics","cURL"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Target URL: http://localhost:4321/teams/medium-enet-8258.webp","Status: HTTP 200 OK","Content-Type: image/webp","Size: 9628 bytes"],"files":["/teams/medium-enet-8258.webp"],"id":"obs_mpvurtzu_8c43983981b6","importance":3,"narrative":"Verified that the static asset server at localhost:4321 is correctly serving the team logo file. The successful response confirms the file path and server configuration are operational for image retrieval.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Checking HTTP availability of team logo","timestamp":"2026-06-01T23:41:47.009Z","title":"Verify static asset accessibility","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvvivsk_e0965ed291cc":{"concepts":["timer logic","match state management","edge case handling"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Match clock displays 45 minutes elapsed past the expected 5-minute threshold","System failed to trigger half-time break","Missing functionality for injury time (stoppage time) logic"],"files":["src/components/MatchTimer.js","src/hooks/useMatchEngine.js"],"id":"obs_mpvvivsk_e0965ed291cc","importance":6,"narrative":"The user reported that the match timer is incorrectly counting past the regulation period instead of transitioning to half-time. Furthermore, the system lacks support for calculating and displaying stoppage time (e.g., +3 minutes).","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Reporting bug in match clock behavior","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:02:49.048Z","title":"User feedback on match timer display","type":"conversation"},"obs_mpvvjb1n_74fd6749fc7e":{"concepts":["schema discovery","live data handling","Drizzle ORM","Astro framework"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Live match time tracking is rendered in 22 files across components, pages, and API routes.","Database schema in src/db/schema/sports.ts uses currentMinute (integer) and addedMinute (integer) for live data.","Match status is managed by the matchStatusEnum pgEnum with default value 'scheduled'."],"files":["src/db/schema/sports.ts","src/components/react/LiveMatchUpdater.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpvvjb1n_74fd6749fc7e","importance":4,"narrative":"Performed a grep search to map dependencies for match minute tracking. The results confirm that minute-related data is dispersed across the UI components, Astro pages, and cron/API endpoints, while the database schema explicitly handles time via currentMinute and addedMinute fields.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Identifying code responsible for live minute rendering and database storage","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:03:08.817Z","title":"Locate minute tracking and schema fields","type":"search"},"obs_mpvvj