vq_fdeaa584047e":{"concepts":["Astro framework","Data hydration","Conditional data fetching","API synchronization"],"confidence":1,"facts":["The file performs data transformation from server-side match objects to a SingleMatch frontend interface.","Auto-enhance logic triggers for live matches or finished matches with empty event/lineup/stat data.","Match details are re-fetched after calling enhanceMatchDetails to ensure current state.","The page renders a SingleMatchApp component with hydration via client:load."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/meciuri/[id].astro"],"id":"obs_mpvvjwvq_fdeaa584047e","importance":3,"narrative":"Analyzed the dynamic match page template in Astro. The implementation ensures that live match data or fresh finished match data is proactively enhanced via API calls before being hydrated into the SingleMatchApp React component.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Examing data transformation and auto-enhance logic in [id].astro","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:03:37.116Z","title":"Read match page implementation","type":"file_read"},"obs_mpvvk42j_9946ba9b7b0d":{"concepts":["Node.js runtime","Postgres SQL","Live match data inspection"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Match ID: match_1780316194889_k8zswb9nl","Status: live, Minute: 45","Score: Colombia 2 - 1 Costa Rica","Last update: 2026-06-01T21:03:25.947Z"],"files":[".env"],"id":"obs_mpvvk42j_9946ba9b7b0d","importance":4,"narrative":"Executed a Node.js script to query the sports_matches table for the Colombia vs Costa Rica game. Confirmed the match is currently live at the 45th minute with a 2-1 score, providing context for subsequent live update debugging.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Verified live match status and score via direct SQL query","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:03:46.421Z","title":"Inspect Colombia vs Costa Rica match state in database","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvvkkv6_31fb250ac94e":{"concepts":["API integration","data normalization","job scheduling","state machine"],"confidence":1,"facts":["The mapStatus function handles soccer feed codes: FT/AET/AP/PEN/AWD/FRO are mapped to 'finished'.","Live status is identified by codes LIVE/1H/2H/HT/ET/BREAK/PENLIVE or numeric strings.","Current minute extraction uses regex ^(\\d+) on the 'Eps' feed field.","Matches stuck in 'live' status for >3.5 hours without feed data are automatically finished."],"files":["src/pages/api/jobs/live-matches.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvvkkv6_31fb250ac94e","importance":4,"narrative":"The codebase syncs match statuses by mapping Livescore API 'Eps' strings to internal 'finished'/'live'/'scheduled' states. The analysis reveals how match time (minute) is extracted from the 'Eps' string and how existing statuses are preserved or overridden based on live feed data.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Reviewing mapStatus and match status updates in live-matches.ts","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:04:08.196Z","title":"Inspect live-matches job status parsing logic","type":"file_read"},"obs_mpvvlltc_6254bf890cc1":{"concepts":["API integration","Drizzle ORM","state reconciliation","data scraping"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Endpoint fetches candidates within a 6-hour window (-4h to +2h).","Uses Drizzle ORM to join internal match IDs with external Livescore Eids via importEntityMappings.","Fetches match data from Livescore API for current and previous day.","Includes fallback logic to mark matches as 'finished' if status is 'live' and event started > 3.5 hours ago.","Prevents status regression from 'live'/'finished' back to 'scheduled'."],"files":["src/pages/api/jobs/live-matches.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvvlltc_6254bf890cc1","importance":4,"narrative":"The API endpoint processes live match updates by reconciling internal database states with external Livescore feed data. It implements defensive status management, specifically handling stale live matches and preventing erroneous state downgrades caused by transient feed data.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Analyzing sports match status reconciliation logic","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:04:56.085Z","title":"Read live-matches API endpoint logic","type":"file_read"},"obs_mpvvmf8k_2f7399638353":{"concepts":["React conditional rendering","Zod schema validation","TypeScript type inference","live match state"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Match status is derived from status, initialMatch.status, or currentMinute.","Live matches display 'MINUTUL {currentMinute}' or 'PAUZĂ' if currentMinute is null/0.","SingleMatch type is inferred from Zod schema in src/lib/validations/matches.ts.","currentMinute field exists in src/lib/server/matches.ts and supports number | null."],"files":["src/components/react/meciuri/SingleMatchApp.tsx","src/components/react/meciuri/MatchStatusCard.tsx","src/lib/server/matches.ts","src/lib/validations/matches.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvvmf8k_2f7399638353","importance":4,"narrative":"Investigated the scoreboard's live render logic to understand how currentMinute is utilized for status displays. Confirmed that the UI components correctly toggle between \"LIVE\" status and \"PAUZĂ\" based on the currentMinute field found in the SingleMatch Zod schema.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Examining live match state handling in SingleMatchApp and MatchStatusCard","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:05:34.216Z","title":"Inspect scoreboard live render logic and SingleMatch type definitions","type":"file_read"},"obs_mpvvmqlm_9b9a4bb12b10":{"concepts":["React component architecture","String pattern matching","Codebase navigation"],"confidence":1,"facts":["SingleMatchApp.tsx uses MatchHeader for scoreboard functionality.","MatchHeader.tsx is confirmed to exist in the same directory.","\"LIVE\" status is displayed via MatchStatusCard.tsx using the text \"LIVE\".","\"desfășurare\" string is present in MatchActions.tsx for live match notifications."],"files":["src/components/react/meciuri/Si