427c9318dc5":{"concepts":["Drizzle ORM","database schema","sports tracking","data modeling"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Added liveLabel (text) field to the sports table schema.","Field supports non-integer status indicators like \"45+2\", \"HT\", and \"ET\"."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/db/schema/sports.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvvogul_8427c9318dc5","importance":6,"narrative":"The existing currentMinute integer field was insufficient to represent non-numeric match statuses such as stoppage time or halftime indicators. Added a new liveLabel text column to allow for accurate on-screen representation of raw Livescore status data.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Updating database schema for improved live match status tracking","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:07:09.615Z","title":"Add liveLabel field to sports schema","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvvoka3_f6183449ed6a":{"concepts":["SQL migration","database schema change","data normalization"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Added live_label text column to sports_matches table","Migration file: 0005_live_label.sql","Enables storage of non-integer time indicators like \"45+2\", \"HT\", \"ET\""],"files":["src/db/migrations/0005_live_label.sql"],"id":"obs_mpvvoka3_f6183449ed6a","importance":5,"narrative":"A new migration was created to add a live_label column to the sports_matches table. This allows the scoreboard to display granular status information from the Livescore API instead of just integer minutes.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Adding raw status string support to matches","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:07:14.059Z","title":"Created migration for sports_matches.live_label","type":"file_write"},"obs_mpvvonm4_0b285d3d5fa6":{"concepts":["Astro API Routes","Drizzle ORM","External Data Fetching"],"confidence":1,"facts":["File location: /Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/api/jobs/live-matches.ts","Uses Astro APIRoute type and Drizzle ORM query builders","Dependencies include sportsMatches and importEntityMappings schemas","Axios is imported for potential external data fetching"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/api/jobs/live-matches.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvvonm4_0b285d3d5fa6","importance":3,"narrative":"The agent read the initial lines of the live-matches API route to understand its data fetching and database integration strategy. This context is essential for analyzing how live match data is processed and stored within the application.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Examining imports and initial structure of live-matches.ts","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:07:18.384Z","title":"Read live-matches API route implementation","type":"file_read"},"obs_mpvvotq1_ba52161be098":{"concepts":["Drizzle ORM","Database Query Optimization","Background Job Synchronization"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Changed query logic to prioritize matches near 'now' for status detection.","Removed date-range restriction for matches marked 'isLive' or 'live' status.","Enables continued synchronization for hung live matches outside the 4h-2h window."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/api/jobs/live-matches.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvvotq1_ba52161be098","importance":6,"narrative":"The previous query constrained all match lookups (scheduled and live) to a fixed time window. This caused issues where live matches that stopped updating (e.g., hanging at HT) were ignored by the sync job once they exited the window, preventing them from being closed. The updated logic splits these conditions to ensure all live matches are processed while keeping scheduled match lookup scoped to the relevant time frame.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Decoupling scheduled match detection from live status persistence","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:07:26.301Z","title":"Refactor live match database query logic","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvvp1l8_e6147b54be65":{"concepts":["data normalization","API integration","live data parsing"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Added parsing logic to strip trailing single quotes from event status strings (Eps).","Implemented 'liveLabel' field storage to preserve non-numeric status indicators like \"HT\" or \"45+2\".","Ensured 'liveLabel' is cleared when a match status transitions to 'finished'.","Retained numeric parsing logic for currentMinute to support sorting."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/api/jobs/live-matches.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvvp1l8_e6147b54be65","importance":4,"narrative":"The match data processing was updated to capture more granular status information from the Livescore API. By stripping the trailing quote from the raw string and storing the label, the UI can now accurately display states like half-time and stoppage time rather than just raw numeric minutes.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Improved live match parsing for stoppage time and halftime labels","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:07:36.494Z","title":"Update live match polling to capture raw status labels","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvvp5t0_310518a8ae70":{"concepts":["Drizzle ORM","database schema maintenance","event-driven state management"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Updated sportsMatches database update query when status transitions to \"finished\".","Added liveLabel: null to clear active display labels upon completion.","Added finishedAt: now to record the exact completion time of the match."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/api/jobs/live-matches.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvvp5t0_310518a8ae70","importance":5,"narrative":"Refined the match completion logic within the live-matches job. By clearing the liveLabel and setting an explicit finishedAt timestamp, the system improves data hygiene and auditability for finished sports matches.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Added liveLabel nulling and finishedAt timestamp to match termination","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:07:41.961Z","title":"Update match status finalization logic","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvvp9un_1485e5abc130":{"concepts":["TypeScript interfaces","Data modeling","Type definition update"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Added 'liveLabel' (string | null) to the MatchWithTeamsAndCompetition type definition.","Modified /Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/lib/server/matches.ts."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/lib/server/matches.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvvp9un_1485e5abc130","importance":4,"narrative":"Updated the core TypeScript type definition for match data to include a 'liveLabel' field. This field will likely be used to display formatted status information for live matches in the frontend.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Added liveLabel property to Match interface","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:07:47.202Z","title":"Update MatchWithTeamsAndCompetition type definition","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvvpme8_2354c4ef067e":{"concepts":["Drizzle ORM","database schema mapping","data transfer object"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Added liveLabel field to the select statement for match data retrieval.","The liveLabel field is sourced from matchesTable.liveLabel.","Target file: /Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/lib/server/matches.ts"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/lib/server/matches.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvvpme8_2354c4ef067e","importance":4,"narrative":"Updated the database query logic to include the liveLabel field, ensuring match status strings are correctly mapped from the database. This allows the frontend to display real-time labels (like \"HT\", \"FT\", or match minutes) alongside match scores.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Updating database query in matches.ts","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:08:03.460Z","title":"Add liveLabel field to match data selection","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvvppmx_243712167b97":{"concepts":["Zod validation","schema definition","data integrity"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Retrieved lines 36-43 of matches.ts","Schema includes homeScoreAc