gle and by-date match API endpoints correctly expose the currentMinute field from the underlying match object. However, there is no evidence of liveLabel being explicitly mapped in these files, suggesting it might be missing or handled elsewhere.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Checking API endpoint data propagation","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:10:20.576Z","title":"Verify liveLabel and currentMinute mapping in match endpoints","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvvsqbu_3ad38d07ee37":{"concepts":["API response mapping","Data normalization","Nullish coalescing"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Read lines 42-53 of src/pages/api/matches/single.ts","Mapping fields: competition, currentMinute, homeScoreActual, awayScoreActual, round, and venue","Fields use nullish coalescing to handle undefined values"],"files":["src/pages/api/matches/single.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvvsqbu_3ad38d07ee37","importance":3,"narrative":"The agent examined the data mapping logic for a match object in the API response handler. This revealed how core match data (scores, competition, timing) is structured and normalized before being sent to the client.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Inspecting match data mapping in single.ts","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:10:28.523Z","title":"Read match object transformation in API handler","type":"file_read"},"obs_mpvvsubr_f51513579e74":{"concepts":["API contract","Astro API route","Data normalization"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Added liveLabel property to the singleMatch object in src/pages/api/matches/single.ts","liveLabel is mapped from match.liveLabel with an undefined fallback"],"files":["src/pages/api/matches/single.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvvsubr_f51513579e74","importance":4,"narrative":"The API response for single match details was updated to include a liveLabel field, which is likely used for improved UI state representation on the frontend during live match updates. The change ensures the live status string is propagated t