tem"],"confidence":1,"facts":["pariuri.astro fetches upcoming matches using getUpcomingMatches(40)","Matches are serialized into a payload for client-side consumption","Page uses a two-column grid layout for matches and betslip","Includes helper for country code conversion (e.g., Romania to ROU)","Uses BasicLayout and standard match date formatting"],"files":["src/pages/pariuri.astro"],"id":"obs_mpvvzfmn_63dec71ebba3","importance":3,"narrative":"Inspected src/pages/pariuri.astro to understand how match data is fetched and passed to the frontend. The file manages data aggregation on the server-side, serializing matches before rendering, and sets up a grid layout for potential betting interactions.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Examining match data orchestration and coupon layout","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:15:41.249Z","title":"Inspect pariuri.astro implementation","type":"file_read"},"obs_mpvw0ncw_21f4dc55c108":{"concepts":["data serialization","database introspection","scoring logic","PostgreSQL integration"],"confidence":1,"facts":["ai_comprehensive_predictions table contains 62 records across 23 unique matches.","Prediction JSON fields include final_result_prediction, over_under_prediction, both_teams_score_prediction, and exact_score_prediction.","ComprehensiveVerdicts interface defines scoring logic; points are aggregated based on MARKET_POINTS constant.","scoring.ts contains functions for scoring specific markets: outcomeOf, scoreFinalResult, scoreExact, scoreOverUnder, scoreBtts, and scoreComprehensive."],"files":["src/lib/scoring.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvw0ncw_21f4dc55c108","importance":4,"narrative":"The agent inspected the structure of prediction data stored in the database to understand how AI model outputs are serialized. It also grepped scoring.ts to identify the logic governing points calculation and market evaluation. This context is essential for mapping prediction values to the existing scoring interface.","sessionId":"945f