tores predictions as JSON strings while the application uses specific interfaces in src/lib/scoring.ts to validate those predictions against match results.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Examining first_goalscorer_prediction JSON and src/lib/scoring.ts","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:20:49.106Z","title":"Inspect prediction data and scoring logic","type":"file_read"},"obs_mpvw78ps_727a4c653f86":{"concepts":["Betting system","Accumulator odds","Persistence layer","Faucet implementation"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Scope includes AI-derived odds calculation","Features backend persistence and settlement logic","Implements crystal payouts as a faucet mechanism"],"files":[],"id":"obs_mpvw78ps_727a4c653f86","importance":7,"narrative":"The session has been segmented to focus on the development of a multi-market accumulator betting system. This chapter encompasses the full lifecycle of a bet, from AI-generated odds to backend settlement and user reward integration.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Multi-market accumulator betting system architecture","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:21:45.543Z","title":"Initialize Bilet / pariuri system chapter","type":"task"},"obs_mpvw7d57_2a85aa7cd25d":{"concepts":["LangChain","Drizzle ORM","API Route","Schema discovery"],"confidence":1,"facts":["src/pages/api/ai/comprehensive-predictions.ts uses LangChain and Drizzle ORM.","No tables related to \"BetSlip\" or \"predBet\" currently exist in the database schema directory.","The endpoint expects a ComprehensivePredictionRequest which includes a comprehensive boolean flag."],"files":["src/pages/api/ai/comprehensive-predictions.ts","src/db/schema/"],"id":"obs_mpvw7d57_2a85aa7cd25d","importance":4,"narrative":"I analyzed the implementation of the comprehensive-predictions API endpoint to understand how it processes data and integrates with the current schema. Concurrently, I searched for existing bet-slip related tables to determine if a new schema migration is required for upcoming features.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Verifying endpoint structure and searching for bet-related tables","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:21:51.281Z","title":"Inspect predictions endpoint and check database schema","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvw8w63_4d912057de55":{"concepts":["betting odds calculation","Poisson distribution","market overround","probabilistic consensus"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Implemented probability-to-odds conversion using a fixed 8% house margin.","Supported markets: final_result, exact_score, over_under_goals, both_teams_score, first_goalscorer.","Includes Poisson distribution logic to calculate odds for exact scorelines.","Uses a clamping mechanism to keep odds within [1.04, 15] for standard markets and [2.0, 50] for exact scores."],"files":["src/lib/server/odds.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvw8w63_4d912057de55","importance":7,"narrative":"Created a new utility module to derive betting odds from aggregated AI model predictions. This service consumes parsed prediction data and applies an 8% house margin overround to ensure sustainable betting payouts based on AI consensus confidence.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"src/lib/server/odds.ts implementation","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:23:02.591Z","title":"Created odds calculation engine","type":"file_write"},"obs_mpvw99y1_5ac60bd1673c":{"concepts":["Drizzle ORM","PostgreSQL schema","Relational modeling"],"confidence":1,"facts":["predictions.ts contains predPredictions, predChallenges, and predLeaderboardEntries tables","Tables utilize drizzle-orm/pg-core for Postgres schema definition","Foreign keys link to authUsers and sportsMatches","schema/index.ts aggregates exports from auth, sports, stats, predictions, imports, and market modules"],"files":["src/db/schema/predictions.ts","src/db/schema/index.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvw99y1_5ac60bd1673c","importance":3,"narrative":"Performed an inspection of the Drizzle ORM schema to understand how prediction and challenge data is structured. Identified the key table definitions and confirmed they are correctly aggregated in the central schema index.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Examined predictions.ts and schema index","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:23:20.447Z","title":"Inspect Drizzle schema definitions for predictions","type":"file_read"},"obs_mpvw9dyu_741d1f5bdffe":{"concepts":["Drizzle ORM","PostgreSQL schema","Database modeling"],"confidence":1,"facts":["File uses Drizzle ORM pg-core definitions.","Imports include pgTable, text, integer, boolean, timestamp, jsonb, pgEnum, and unique.","Schema file establishes a dependency on auth users schema.","The file contains 225 total lines of code."],"files":["src/db/schema/predictions.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvw9dyu_741d1f5bdffe","importance":2,"narrative":"The agent inspected the beginning of the predictions schema file to understand the database modeling approach. This context is necessary for preparing future modifications or queries related to the predictions table.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Inspecting imports and table definitions in src/db/schema/predictions.ts","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:23:25.658Z","title":"Read predictions schema file header","type":"file_read"},"obs_mpvw9jfu_55d28b8f1d9a":{"concepts":["Drizzle ORM","Database Schema","TypeScript","Relational Mapping"],"confidence":1,"facts":["File length is 224 lines","Table uses Drizzle ORM syntax","Defined relations include aiUser and match","Schema includes audit fields like createdAt"],"files":["src/db/schema/predictions.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvw9jfu_55d28b8f1d9a","importance":3,"narrative":"The agent inspected the end of the schema file to understand the current structure and relationships of the predictions table. This context is necessary for preparing future modifications or queries related to user-match predictions.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","sub