ide odds recomputation to prevent client-side manipulation.","Constraints implemented: 10-100k stake range, max 12 legs per slip.","Strict validation for market types (final_result, over_under_goals, etc.) and match scheduling status.","Uses CUID for unique ID generation."],"files":["src/pages/api/bets/place.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvwe2it_f25ef0536d77","importance":8,"narrative":"Implemented the server-side logic for placing accumulator bets. The endpoint validates user existence, ensures matches are in a \"scheduled\" state, and performs strict validation on betting market selections before processing the slip.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"src/pages/api/bets/place.ts","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:27:04.062Z","title":"Created bet placement API endpoint","type":"file_write"},"obs_mpvwe6j5_b36c1132ea0a":{"concepts":["Astro API Routes","Idempotency","Backend Automation"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Endpoint is an Astro APIRoute","Logic delegates to resolvePendingDuels utility","Route is idempotent and intended for scheduled execution","Returns JSON with status 200 on success or 500 on error"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/api/challenges/resolve.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvwe6j5_b36c1132ea0a","importance":3,"narrative":"The API route provides an idempotent mechanism to settle finished duels, likely triggered by a cron job. It abstracts the resolution logic to the resolvePendingDuels function and includes basic error handling.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Examining POST /api/challenges/resolve endpoint","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:27:09.303Z","title":"Read resolve API route implementation","type":"file_read"},"obs_mpvweck9_95d6713237a2":{"concepts":["API orchestration","idempotent operations","background task processing"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Added import for settlePendingBetSlips from ../../../lib/server/bets","Updated /api/challenges/resolve POST handler to execute settlePendingBetSlips alongside resolvePendingDuels","Modified JSON response to include bet settlement results"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/api/challenges/resolve.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvweck9_95d6713237a2","importance":5,"narrative":"The challenge resolution endpoint was updated to handle both duels and bet slips simultaneously. This ensures that when match statuses are synced via the cron job, both related financial and competitive structures are settled in a single atomic operation.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Updated /api/challenges/resolve to include settlePendingBetSlips","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:27:17.118Z","title":"Integrate bet slip settlement into resolve endpoint","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvwf2sb_899749b8f315":{"concepts":["Node.js module resolution","ESM imports","tsx"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Created temporary script /tmp/test-odds.mjs to verify odds derivation logic","Encountered ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND when importing local file ./src/lib/server/odds.ts","The script attempted to resolve relative to /private/tmp instead of project root"],"files":["/tmp/test-odds.mjs","src/lib/server/odds.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvwf2sb_899749b8f315","importance":3,"narrative":"An attempt was made to create and execute a script to test betting odds calculations. The execution failed because the relative import path was resolved incorrectly by Node.js due to the script being located in /tmp.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Path resolution error when running mjs file via tsx","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:27:51.101Z","title":"Failed attempt to execute odds verification script","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvwfajw_b398d0cf1ae8":{"concepts":["data validation","script-based testing","integration testing"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Successfully fetched odds for 'colombia-vs-costa-rica-2026-06-01' using getOddsForMatches.","Verified structure of output: 1X2, O/U, GG/NG, First Goalscorer, and Exact Score.","Confirmed model count is 3 for the 