nnectivity using credentials from the .env file.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Database inspection via Node.js script","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:28:27.557Z","title":"Query human users from auth_users table","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvwg9n3_9c2f680f757f":{"concepts":["API integration testing","betting engine","JSON payload validation"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Successfully placed 2-leg bet via POST /api/bets/place","Bet stake: 100, Total Odds: 3.54, Potential Payout: 354","Resulting user balance: 9790","Matches: match_1780316194891_ngeu59r7k (final_result: 1), match_1780316194893_q7ww6j41m (over_under_goals: over)"],"files":["/api/bets/place"],"id":"obs_mpvwg9n3_9c2f680f757f","importance":5,"narrative":"Executed a cURL command to verify the 2-leg betting functionality on the local API server. The response confirmed that the bet was processed successfully with correct odds calculation and balance updates.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Verified API endpoint functionality for multi-leg betting","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:28:46.644Z","title":"Test 2-leg bet placement","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvwgvs0_32ebb70f657d":{"concepts":["API testing","database cleanup","transactional integrity","node-postgres"],"confidence":1,"facts":["POST /api/challenges/resolve returned success=true with 0 matches/bets processed.","Deleted test bet slip 'ltyh1ktoepj4nzv1kaz5ujmw' and related leg/transaction records via postgres.","Restored 100 crystals to user 'br4d7t929128xzzvb08f0zxt' balance.","Final user balance confirmed at 9890 crystals."],"files":[".env"],"id":"obs_mpvwgvs0_32ebb70f657d","importance":5,"narrative":"Performed a smoke test on the challenge resolution API to ensure it handles scheduled matches as a no-op. Subsequently, manually cleaned up test database artifacts and reverted user currency balances to maintain a clean testing environment state.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subt