tion pipeline to map match and odds data into the BetSlipApp component props.","Added dynamic checking for daily free bets and crystal balance.","Added helper functions for country code standardization and localized date formatting."],"files":["src/pages/pariuri.astro"],"id":"obs_mpvwkfuc_7a344eccbbf7","importance":5,"narrative":"I updated the betting page to integrate server-side data fetching for matches and odds. The page now correctly filters for bettable matches that have AI consensus odds and passes the user's free-bet status and balance into the React component.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Injecting live betting data into the Pariuri page","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:32:01.302Z","title":"Update Betting Page implementation","type":"file_write"},"obs_mpvwkof7_ff74d538fa7b":{"concepts":["Astro islands","Hydration check","Component verification"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Endpoint /pariuri returns HTTP 200","Detected 11 astro-island instances","Detected 19 instances each of exact_score, final_result, and over_under_goals in payload","BetSlipApp component verified present"],"files":["/pariuri"],"id":"obs_mpvwkof7_ff74d538fa7b","importance":4,"narrative":"The Pariuri page is correctly serving content with 11 hydration islands. The presence of match data keys confirms the expected API-to-client hydration pipeline is functioning for sports betting data.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Checking astro-island payload and component presence","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:32:12.425Z","title":"Verify Pariuri page rendering and island hydration","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvwl2pr_dbe37f62dc17":{"concepts":["TypeScript","Static Analysis","Module Resolution"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Found TS2305 error in src/pages/api/predictions.ts","Missing exported member 'userPredictionsTable' in '../../db/schema'","Total TypeScript error count remains at 62"],"files":["src/pages/api/predictions.ts","db/schema.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvwl2pr_dbe37f62dc17","importance":4,"narrative":"A targeted typecheck was performed on betting-related modules to isolate errors. The diagnostic revealed a missing export in the database schema, but the overall error baseline remained unchanged.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Verifying TypeScript status for betting logic modules","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:32:30.950Z","title":"Typecheck bet slip related files","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvwliyz_e1addabfb2b1":{"concepts":["API testing","PostgreSQL integration","State verification","Database cleanup"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Verified that free bet placement succeeds and does not impact user balance.","Verified that second free bet attempt returns error code 'FREE_USED'.","Automated cleanup script removed test slip entries from PostgreSQL.","User balance confirmed at 9890 after successful free bet operation."],"files":[".env"],"id":"obs_mpvwliyz_e1addabfb2b1","importance":5,"narrative":"The test suite confirmed that the system correctly handles free bet placement, enforces a daily usage limit, and preserves user account balance. A cleanup script was executed to remove the created test records directly from the database to maintain test environment hygiene.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"End-to-end test of free bet placement and cleanup","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:32:52.016Z","title":"Verify Free Bet logic and limit enforcement","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvx28tv_154b306d8790":{"concepts":["cron scheduling","task orchestration","rate limiting","game economy"],"confidence":1,"facts":["New cron job added to the orchestrator for automated processing.","User ticket limit set to 3 free tickets per day.","Ticket cost fixed at 20 crystals for additional entries.","Ticket history tracking enabled for users."],"files":["src/orchestrator/cron.ts","src/services/ticketService.ts","src/models/ticket.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvx28tv_154b306d8790","importance":7,"narrative":"The user requested the integration of a cron job into the orchestrator to automate ticket management. I have implemented a system that enforces a 3-ticket daily limit for free users and allows additional entries at a cost of 20 crystals, while also persisting ticket history.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Integration of automated scheduling and user ticket constraints","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:45:52.023Z","title":"Implement Cron Job and Daily Ticket Limit","type":"task"},"obs_mpvx2ouy_d54d3e6edd9c":{"concepts":["Astro framework","Server-side data fetching","Authentication gate","User statistics aggregation"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Page redirects to /auth/login if no currentUser is found.","Data fetching uses Promise.all for getUserDuels and getMyPosition.","Calculates win rate, crystal totals, and streaks client-side within the Astro frontmatter.","Displays user stats including rank, level, and duel outcomes.","Uses custom CSS variables (e.g., --sb-paper, --sb-accent) for theming."],"files":["src/pages/profil.astro"],"id":"obs_mpvx2ouy_d54d3e6edd9c","importance":3,"narrative":"Read the profil.astro page to understand how user data and duel statistics are aggregated and displayed. The component logic handles authentication checks, data aggregation for performance, and dynamic UI rendering based on the user's current standing.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Inspection of user profile page data fetching and rendering","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:46:12.798Z","title":"Read profil.astro page implementation","type":"file_read"},"obs_mpvx3ufk_0c2f83c7a253":{"concepts":["Drizzle ORM","rate limiting","UTC date logic","faucet pattern"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Replaced boolean hasUsedFreeBetToday with freeBetsUsedToday (count) and freeBetsLeftToday (remaining)","Introduced FREE_BETS_PER_DAY constant set to 3","Retained existing UTC-based date logic for row filtering"],"files":["src/lib/server/bets.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvx3ufk_0c2f83c7a253","importance":5,"narrative":"The system was updated to allow users a daily \"faucet\" of 3 free bets instead of a binary single-use constraint. The logic was moved from checking existence to counting total free bet slips within the current UTC day, providing better support for promotional free-to-play features.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Refactored bet limiting to support multiple free bets per day","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:47:06.680Z","title":"Replace single free bet check with multi-bet daily faucet logic","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvx43dx_7c149382f0d4":{"concepts":["TypeScript interface","Betting system architecture","Data normalization"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Updated leg type definition in /src/lib/server/bets.ts","Added matchLabel (string) and matchSlug (string) fields","These fields enable front-end display of bet details without secondary lookups"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/lib/server/bets.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvx43dx_7c149382f0d4","importance":5,"narrative":"The data structure for bet slip legs was expanded to include UI-friendly identifiers (matchLabel and matchSlug). This change ensures that the betting history and active slip views can render match information directly from the bet record.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Added matchLabel and matchSlug to bet leg interface","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:47:18.284Z","title":"Update Bet Slip Leg schema","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvx465o_acdc7c30de0c":{"concepts":["Drizzle ORM","data aggregation","DTO mapping","N+1 optimization"],"confidence":1,"facts":["The code performs a database query on predBetSlipLegs using an array of slip IDs.","It manually groups legs into a Map by slipId before mapping them to the final DTO structure.","The result is returned in reverse chronological order."],"files":["src/lib/server/bets.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvx465o_acdc7c30de0c","importance":3,"narrative":"The system retrieves bet legs and maps them to their respective bet slips using an in-memory Map. This logic is crucial for assembling the full bet object with all associated legs before returning to the client.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Inspection of leg grouping logic in bets.ts","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:47:21.876Z","title":"Read bet slip data aggregation logic","type":"file_read"},"obs_mpvx4j0p_0c4c7feff12a":{"concepts":["Drizzle ORM","Database join","Data enrichment","Aliased tables"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Added database query to fetch match home/away names and slugs for slip legs.","Used aliasedTable for home and away teams to resolve match labels.","Updated mapping logic to include matchLabel and matchSlug in the returned slip object."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/lib/server/bets.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvx4j0p_0c4c7feff12a","importance":5,"narrative":"Enhanced the bet slip data retrieval process by joining match information with slip legs. This allows the UI to display readable match descriptions (e.g., \"Home Team – Away Team\") and navigate to match pages via slugs without additional client-side requests.","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","subtitle":"Added match labels and slugs to bet slip data fetching","timestamp":"2026-06-02T00:47:38.539Z","title":"Inject match metadata into bet slip legs","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvx4uhd_029c5c01f184":{"concepts":["Drizzle ORM","Database Schema","Relational Queries"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Imported `sportsTeams` from ../../db/schema","Imported `alias` from drizzle-orm/pg-core"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/lib/server/bets.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvx4uhd_029c5c01f184","importance":4,"narrative":"Updated the imports in the betting settlement service to include support for team data and alias functionality. This is likely in preparation for joining sports teams or performing more complex relational queries during the bet settlement process.","sessionId":"945fa316